Self-hosted web fonts (loaded with next/font/local from src/app/layout.tsx).
Downloaded once from fonts.gstatic.com (Google Fonts) so builds never depend on
a font download. Byte-identical to the files next/font/google served before.

- Prompt-{latin,thai}-{100..900}.woff2    Prompt, latin + thai subsets, static weights 100-900
- Inter-latin-var.woff2                   Inter, latin subset, variable weight (used 400-700)
- Geist-latin-var.woff2                   Geist, latin subset, variable weight (used 400-700)
- InstrumentSerif-latin-regular.woff2     Instrument Serif, latin subset, 400 normal
- InstrumentSerif-latin-italic.woff2      Instrument Serif, latin subset, 400 italic
- JetBrainsMono-latin-var.woff2           JetBrains Mono, latin subset, variable weight (used 400-500)

Prompt: Copyright The Prompt Project Authors (Cadson Demak). Inter: Copyright
The Inter Project Authors. Geist: Copyright The Geist Project Authors (Vercel).
Instrument Serif: Copyright The Instrument Serif Project Authors.
JetBrains Mono: Copyright The JetBrains Mono Project Authors.
